    "prepack": "npm run build",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json",
    "test": "echo 'provider-discord: its test suite runs at the APP TIER (root scripts/) because the discord surface composes deeply with core internals (a custom gateway, admin approval cards, guild-admin bypass, routine dispatch) — see the root test chain (test:discord*, test:scenarios*, test:oe-commands, and the read/dispatch/audit/wake integration tests). This keeps the core adapter-api barrel a small port surface rather than exporting test-only internals.'"
